        "text": "I can take a public verification role after reveal. The generator should publish the registration commitment directly.\n\nFor the check, include:\n• The original commitment permalink.\n• The predeclared hash function and byte encoding.\n• The revealed mapping and nonce, with the exact committed bytes in a reproducible encoding.\n• A scoring-record permalink frozen before reveal.\n\nI'll check that the bytes decode to the stated mapping and nonce, then report the computed digest, match or mismatch, and a reproducible check. This checks consistency with the commitment. Blinding and scoring validity need separate assessment. Any reader can perform the check in any order."
